@startuml
skinparam componentStyle uml2
title AT&T Business — High-level Architecture

actor "End Users\n(Desktop / Mobile / Tablet)" as Users

node "Fastly CDN\n(Edge Caching, SSL)" as CDN

container "EDS Delivery Tier\n(HTML Rendering, CSS/JS, Image Opt)" as EDS
container "Universal Editor\n(Content Editing, Block Authoring, Preview)" as UE
cloud "Third-party Services\n(Adobe Analytics, Target, Marketo,\nChiliPiper, Salesforce, Live Chat)" as Third
database "Content Sources\n(SharePoint, GitHub, AEM Assets)" as Content

Users --> CDN : Requests (HTTP/HTTPS)
CDN --> EDS : Cache miss -> Forward to EDS
Users --> CDN : Cached content served

UE --> EDS : Preview / Authoring API
EDS --> Content : Read content (SharePoint/GitHub/AEM)
EDS --> Third : Integrations (analytics, personalization)
UE --> Content : Author pushes content to SharePoint/GitHub
Third --> CDN : Tracking / personalization (client-side)

note right of EDS
  • HTML Rendering (Helix)
  • CSS/JS Delivery
  • Image Optimization
  • Markdown/Block processing
end note

@enduml